-- One-time data update: Dubai Twister gets a new layout.
--
-- Its own layout and opening (Moses, 15 Nov 2026: the World Tour re-layouts):
-- until now it was physically the same track as Park City Run. Through the
-- dunes (the sand-trap start, the field let go in waves) past the kneeling
-- camels and rally flags, up a red dune and down its face, a sweep over the
-- dunes, the hairpin, S-bends through the skyline, the Twister (the big
-- feature: a long spiral round a twisting skyscraper), the drop past the Burj
-- Al Arab and along the Palm. Its name, slug, look and past races stay. Its
-- track record, country records and players' personal bests start again from
-- now (tracks.records_since); past results stay. Races already run keep their
-- stored replays and play back exactly as they ran.
--
